ader DocBlock parts.\n\nI have identified those files by using the following shell \"script\":\n\n``` bash\ngrep -R -Lc -e \"* CakePHP(tm) : Rapid Development Framework (http://cakephp.org)\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep1.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"* Copyright (c) Cake Software Foundation, Inc. (http://cakefoundation.org)\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep2.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"* Licensed under The MIT License\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep3.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"For full copyright and license information, please see the LICENSE.txt\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep4.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"Redistributions of files must retain the above copyright notice.\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep5.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"* @copyright     Copyright (c) Cake Software Foundation, Inc. (http://cakefoundation.org)\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep6.txt;grep -R -Lc -e \"* @license       http://www.opensource.org/licenses/mit-license.php MIT License\" --include=*.php --include=*.ctp > grep7.txt;cat grep1.txt grep2.txt grep3.txt grep4.txt grep5.txt grep6.txt grep7.txt | sort | uniq > greps.txt\n```\n\nThe parts which are checked are:\n`* CakePHP(tm) : Rapid Development Framework (http://cakephp.org)`\n`* Copyright (c) Cake Software Foundation, Inc. (http://cakefoundation.org)`\n`* Licensed under The MIT License`\n`For full copyright and license information, please see the LICENSE.txt`\n`Redistributions of files must retain the above copyright notice.`\n`* @copyright     Copyright (c) Cake Software Foundation, Inc. (http://cakefoundation.org)`\n`* @license       http://www.opensource.org/licenses/mit-license.php MIT License`\n\nDue to the nature of how they are checked (literal), some reported file could have also have the checked string formatted somewhat differently.\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.